:Swimming rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf :Sports .


###  http://benchmark/OWL2Bench#SystemStaff
:SystemStaff rdf:type owl:Class ;
             rdfs:subClassOf :SupportingStaff .


###  http://benchmark/OWL2Bench#TeachingAssistant
:TeachingAssistant rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf [ owl:intersectionOf ( :Student
                                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                            owl:onProperty :isTeachingAssistantOf ;
                                                            owl:someValuesFrom :Course
                                                          ]
                                                        ) ;
                                     rdf:type owl:Class
                                   ] .


###  http://benchmark/OWL2Bench#TeachingCourse
:TeachingCourse rdf:type owl:Class ;
                rdfs:subClassOf :Work .


###  http://benchmark/OWL2Bench#TechnicalReport
